                <pb facs="0898" n="800" xml:id="pg800"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr.
                            Newel.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-10-13"><hi rendition="#italic">October 13,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>[Mr. Hay instructs Mr. Newel to formally invite Mr. Asser to act as arbitrator,
                    acting concurrently with Russian minister. The two Governments will determine
                    upon his compensation.]</p>
            </div>
